      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\"Gender\" includes an individual's actual or perceived: sex, gender identity, self-image, appearance, behavior, or expression, whether or not that gender identity, self-image, appearance, behavior or expression is different from that traditionally associated with the sex assigned at birth.",
