    {
      "bbox": [
        182,
        657,
        1487,
        924
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\"Gender expression\" means the representation of gender as expressed through, for example, one's name, choice of pronoun, clothing, haircut, behavior, voice, or body characteristics. Gender expressions may not be distinctively male or female and may not conform to gender based stereotypes society assigns to specific gender identities.",
